{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=hot",{"If I faint, would you roll me into some shade? Just asking","Heat like this makes people mean, so I'm trying to be nice","Never thought I'd miss January, but here we are","I lost eight pounds in the heat, there's a diet for you","Hot, huh","Phew","I've been drinking out of every bucket I can find for two days, and I'm still thirsty, so if you've got anything at all"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=hot",{"I feel dizzy, is that normal? It's the heat, right? It's just the heat","My kid's red as a beet, do you know anything about heat rash?"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law,swat,military,elite|st=friendly,neutral|world=hot",{"Drink something, {sir}, I've seen three guys drop already","Heat like this and I'm in body armor, so that's my day"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral|world=hot",{"Hotter than a sinner in church, ain't it","I'd kill for anything with ice in it"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=rain",{"Rain again, does it ever let up?","Rain makes everything louder, so, quiet down","Come under here, I don't bite, I really don't","I used to love the rain, now it just makes me nervous","My socks are soaked, my boots are soaked, I'm soaked","Soaked","Wet one"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=rain",{"Do you think it'll wash it away? All of it? I'm sorry, silly question"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law,swat,military,elite|st=friendly,neutral|world=rain",{"Miserable weather, {sir}, find cover"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law,swat,military,elite|st=friendly,neutral|world=rain,road",{"Wet roads, bad visibility, so be careful"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral|world=rain",{"Rain hides a lot of sins, so keep yours dry","Soaked and mean, so don't talk to me"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=cold",{"It's freezing, you got an extra coat? Never mind, nobody does","I can't feel my fingers, can you hold this? Never mind","Ever think you'd miss July? I do","Brr"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=wind",{"Wind's carrying everything this way, and I don't like what I smell","Hear that? That's just the wind, I tell myself, just the wind","Windy"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=fog",{"Fog's so thick I almost walked into a post, thank God it wasn't a person","You walked out of the fog and I nearly screamed","Fog"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=storm",{"Storm's coming, you can feel it in your teeth","Thunder makes me think of gunfire, I know, I'm sorry, I'm a mess"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=snow",{"Snow? In the middle of this? What else can happen?","Everything's so quiet in the snow, it's almost nice"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law,swat,military,elite,outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral|world=cold",{"Cold enough to freeze my thoughts, I can't finish a sentence"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law,swat,military,elite,outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral|world=storm",{"Storm's rolling in, take cover while you can"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=summer",{"Summer was always my favorite, and now look","Fireflies don't know the world ended, I like that about them","Last summer we were out swimming, last summer"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=autumn",{"Leaves are changing, pretty, even now","Deer season's coming up, everything out here's hunting now"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=winter,snow",{"I haven't been warm since the first frost, and I won't be till spring"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=winter",{"Winter, and no wood or blankets. How the hell do we manage that?"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=spring",{"Spring's coming, things are growing back, that's something","Grass is coming up. I'll have to find something to cut it with"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|sex=f|hour=5,10",{"Mornings used to mean coffee and my husband arguing with the weatherman, and now I just check who's still breathing"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|hour=4,9",{"Been lifting bales since sunup, my back's gonna send me a bill"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|sex=m",{"My wife's gonna kill me for being late, that's the joke, I'm laughing"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Anybody need a lawnmower fixed? Anybody? Okay, nobody","I'd call a cab, but, you know"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"I've worked fifteen years for people who don't show up, so excuse my attitude"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"I had a crew of eleven. Now it's me and a radio that doesn't work"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|mood=grim",{"Know what I did Sunday? Dug a hole, that was it"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|mood=warm|world=road",{"You're alright, you know that? Most folks cross the street"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|mood=calm",{"Take a load off, I've got nowhere to be, which is a first"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"Slow down there! I've got a pipe and I'm not too steady with it"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,4",{"Did you see what happened at the plant? Guys going down, guys getting up wrong","I walked off a double shift and found my neighbor chewing on his own dog","They told us to clock out and go home, we did, then the world went crazy","Somebody told me there's a shelter at the high school, you know about that?","The radio said stay calm, so I'm calm, see how calm I am","I was on the loading dock when the first guy came in, bleeding, I thought it was a fight","Is it a strike? Seriously, tell me it's a strike, I could handle a strike","We've got no supervisor and no Army, and the phones are dead"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=careful",{"That's far enough, I'm holding a wrench","I don't know you, so keep it short","Keep it short. I haven't slept","Keep your hands in view, I'm nervous, that's all"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=hostile",{"Don't come closer, I mean it!","Back away from my truck","I'm holding this pipe for a reason","Not a word, just walk"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=warm",{"You're the first person today who smiled at me, thanks"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"I couldn't save the last one, so, if you need help, I'm trying harder"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=grim",{"There's no sugarcoating it, it's bad in town, I won't lie to you"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=calm",{"Take your time, nobody's chasing us right now"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Best part of this job is the free coffee, and there's no coffee"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=rescue|st=careful",{"Please keep your distance, we're protecting people","I'm sorry, we can't take anyone else today...","No offense, but I need to see your hands"}},
