{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Anybody burned? Don't hide it if you are","We've got a cot at the firehouse, if you need to rest","Don't go in the old mill, the floor's rotten, I checked","Haven't seen a hydrant work in days, so it's buckets now","I was supposed to retire in October, funny how that goes","We pulled a family out of a house on Pine, and they didn't thank us, they just cried","You ever carry a grown man down three flights? I've done it twice this week","Still smells like smoke on me, doesn't it? I can't tell anymore","The rig's out of fuel and I'm out of patience, but I'll listen","We're checking houses for survivors, so, anyone in there?","You smell that? That's burnt hair, don't ask"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_firefighter|st=careful,hostile",{"Don't come any closer, please","Back away, we're carrying people"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Let me see your hands, I'm checking for bites, not being rude","Any fever? Chills? Cough? No? Good, that's something","I don't have much left, but I can look at a cut","If somebody gets bit, come get me, don't try to fix it yourself","I worked ER nights, I thought I knew what bad looked like","Open wide- no, never mind, doctor habit, sorry","Your color's off, are you eating? Drinking? Sleeping at all?","I ran out of antibiotics Tuesday, so if you're sick, tell me early","I'm not a real doctor, I was a nurse's aide, but I'm what there is","You're shaking, that's fear or fever, which is it?","That's a nasty cut, come here, I've still got thread","You're dehydrated, drink this, no arguments, I'm a nurse"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral|psex=f",{"Ma'am, are you pregnant? Sorry, I'm asking everyone, it matters"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_medical|st=careful,hostile",{"Stay back if you're bit, I can't risk it","I can't treat you and defend myself, so please don't make me choose","Please, no closer, I have patients"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Do you mind if I pray over you? It's okay if you do, it's okay if you don't","God's not gone, I promise, He's just quiet","You look like you've lost somebody, I'm sorry, you don't have to say who","I've lost half my flock, I'm sorry, I talk too much when I'm sad","Take a rest, there's a pew in the back with your name on it, metaphorically","Have you eaten? There's a pot of beans going at the fellowship hall","I preached about this once, a sermon about the end, I wish I'd shut up","Forgive me, I don't know what to say, you'd think after thirty years I would","I don't ask anybody to believe anything. Just to sit down and eat","Hello. I'd offer a blessing, but I don't have the words","I don't preach anymore, I listen, would you like to talk?","You don't have to believe, you just have to sit"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral|psex=f",{"Sister, you're welcome in the church, any time"}},
