{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,13",{"Hey, you made it a week, congratulations, I'm still counting too","The Army's gone, you know that? Everybody knows now","I stopped waiting for somebody to come, I just make my own plans","Ten days in, I've got a system, it's mostly luck","I'm out of everything, but I've got a lot of stories, if you want one","You find any batteries? D cells? For the radio, the one that doesn't work","Used to hate Mondays, now I don't even know which one it is","Do you have somebody? Anybody? I've got nobody, so I'm asking","Last week I would've screamed at you, now I'm just glad you're human","Haven't talked to anyone in four days, so, if I ramble, sorry","There's a rumor about a camp near the river, do you know anything?","My house is a ruin, my car's a ruin, I'm the only thing still working"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=14,29",{"Two weeks, you believe that? And I'm still here","We've got a garden going, if you ever want a tomato, ask","You come from the school? They say people are gathering there","I used to think the Army was coming, and then I stopped thinking","There's a woman at the church, she's got a radio, she's the news now","Everybody's learned to cook over a fire, myself included, badly","Sorry, I smell, but nobody's washing anything","We've started a little group, ten of us, if you need anyone"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=30,9999",{"A month, and I'm still counting, don't ask why","You'd be surprised what you get used to, it's sad","We've got chickens now, can you believe that? Chickens","I found a calendar, it's still on July, I keep it that way","My daughter's grown a foot, and I haven't noticed until today","You look healthy, which is more than I can say for me","We stopped thinking about before, it's easier that way"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,13",{"We're down to five deputies, so I'm covering three beats","Command's gone, so I'm the command, God help us"}},
