{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"Don't come any closer, I'm sorry, I'm just scared","You're really a person, you promise? You're not one of them?","I can't stop shaking, I'm sorry, it's not you","Stay there, okay? Just stay there and talk, that's good!","Do you hear that? Do you? That wasn't just me, was it?","I keep thinking something's behind me, and I can't turn around","Say something ordinary. Anything, please","I've not slept or eaten. I'm not making much sense, am I?","I keep thinking I see someone. Then I look again","I'm okay, I'm okay, I'm okay, are you okay?","Just tell me nobody's bit, please, nobody!","I'm so scared I can't think, so, you decide, whatever you say","Please don't be a bad person, I can't handle another bad person!","Every morning I think it'll be over. I still do it"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Excuse me, {sir}, I'm sorry to bother you, do you have a moment?","{Sir}, are you alone? I don't want to be rude, but are you alone?","Hi, {mister}, I'm trying to get to Radcliff, do you know the way?","Hello, {sir}, please, we haven't seen a stranger in days","{Sir}, don't mind me if I keep my hands to myself","Hey, {g:buddy|miss}, got any advice? I'm all out","You look like you've seen it all, {sir}, so tell me, is it getting better?","{Mister}, wait, please, can I ask you something?","Are you hurt, {sir}? Anything broken?","Sorry, {sir}, you looked familiar, I thought you were my cousin...","Yes?","Hello?","Hm?","Hi","Easy","Whoa","Oh, hi","Pardon?","What's up?","Hey, you","Back again","Sorry, who?","My God, a person","I don't know where I'm supposed to be going anymore, and I don't know who's supposed to tell me, so I just keep moving","Hello again","Sorry","Ah","Hi, hi","Hey","Oh","Hm, yes","Well, well","You okay?","Alright?","Sorry, I lost track of the time, hello","Used to be you couldn't walk a block without somebody asking about your mother, and now I'd pay for the question","We had a dog named Pepper who'd bark at anything bigger than a cat, and I'd give an arm to hear him bark at you","Hi... hello... you're real, aren't you?","You okay? Anything broken?","Sorry, I thought you were somebody else","Where'd you come from?","Heading far?","Got a name? Mine's not important","You eat today?","Are you carrying much?","Nice to meet you, I guess","You need a hand with that?","Do I know you? You look so familiar","Do you speak? Sorry, stupid question, you're speaking","Slow down, you're making me nervous","Don't mind me, I'm just stretching my legs","I used to be a runner, and now look","Were you with the group at the school?","You see anything strange back there?","You want to rest? I've got a log","Haven't heard a voice in two days, so, go on, say something","Can I ask a favor? Just walk next to me for a minute?","Are you lost? Because I am","Do you smoke? I'll trade you a good lighter","Hey, easy, I'm not armed, I'm just curious","You alone? Don't answer, it's none of my business","Is it true what they say about the dead? That they remember?","Which way did you come? Was it quiet?","I thought I was the only one left, hi","Hello, {sir}, you look like you could use a rest","{Sir}, may I ask you something? It's quick","Good to meet you, {mister}, I think","Hey, {g:buddy|miss}, you wouldn't have a map?","{Sir}, you're a long way from anywhere","Are you alright, {sir}? You look a bit pale","What's your story, {g:pal|ma'am}? I've got time","{Mister}, do me a favor, don't tell anyone you saw me","Hey, {g:man|lady}, nice to see you, really","Have you seen one up close? I did, and I wish I hadn't","My neighbor's one of those things now, and I can't even look at his house","The kids call them monsters, and I stopped correcting them","They moan, you know? It's the moaning I hear in my sleep","Do you think they can still feel anything? I keep thinking about that","I used to be scared of spiders, can you imagine","You hear them before you see them, it's the shuffle, that dragging sound","We've got a rule, nobody says their names after, it's too hard","I found a piano in a house, I played one song, then I left, I couldn't stay","There was a wedding on Saturday. I wonder where they all went","The paper boy's route is still on my doorstep, I can't bring myself to throw them out","I used to deliver the mail, and now I deliver rumors, same thing","I left a note on my door, 'gone to Mom's', in case anybody comes looking"}},
